    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is22">
        <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e98">Caput 22</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is22-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_1@1-2">Onus vallis.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e109"><seg type="qs">Jerusalem quondam domina gentium</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui de sublimi sensu Scripturarum ad infima corruerunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e117">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1264A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e121" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_1@2-3">Vallis visionis.</quote>
            LXX: Sion, id est speculae, scilicet Ecclesiae.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e125">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e127" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_1@4-6">Quidnam tibi quoque.</quote>
            Quasi diceret: Cum philosophia et sapientia saecularis, de sublimibus disputans, simplicitatem Ecclesiae contemnat, cur, tu quoque sectaris excelsa?
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is22-Dd1e132">
          <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e134">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e136">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e138" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_2@2-2">Plena.</quote>
            Doctrina haereticorum plena est multiloquio et clamore.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e142">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e144" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_2@7-8">Interfecti tui.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is22-Rd1e147"><name xml:id="gom-is22-Nd1e148" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e151">Vallis, scilicet Sion, voluntate propria, ad haereticos scilicet transierunt. Comparatione eorum qui post praelium victi sunt, infelicius vulnerantur qui sponte se tradunt: quomodo in martyrio, qui post poenas negat, levius punitur quam qui sine necessitate Christum abnegat.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is22-Dd1e155">
          <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e157">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e159">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e161" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_3@1-2">Cuncti principes,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e164"><seg type="qs">Sicut in Jeremia <pb ed="#P" n="1264B"/> legitur, Sedechias nocte per muri foramen</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et in Babylonem ducti sunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e174">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e176" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_3@4-4">Fugerunt.</quote>
            In fuga concordes, quorum princeps est draco fugiens, coluber tortuosus.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is22-Dd1e181">
          <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e183">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e185">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e187" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_5@6-7">Et fletuum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is22-Rd1e190"><name xml:id="gom-is22-Nd1e191" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e194">LXX: Erroris. Non quod fletus et error a Domino sit, sed occasione Scripturarum quas dedit eis legendas, nascitur erroris occasio, et possunt dicere: <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e196" source="http://scta.info/resource/is63_17@1-4">Quare nos errare fecisti a via tua?</quote></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is22-Dd1e202">
          <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e204">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e206">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e208" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_6@2-2">Elam.</quote>
            Civitas in Perside provincia, in qua optimi sagittarii: <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e211" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_6@2-4">Elam sumpsit pharetram.</quote> Elam, ascensus eorum, id est superbia haereticorum, sumpsit pharetram, <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e214" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps10_3@12-17">ut sagittet in obscuro rectos corde.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e218">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e220" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_6@9-9">Parietem.</quote>
            Ecclesiae firmamenta, clypeo suo, id est impugnatione nudavit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is22-Dd1e225">
          <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e227">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e229">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1264C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e233" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_8@3-3">Operimentum.</quote>
            Templum quod gentibus et pollutis ante opertum et clausum erat.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e237">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e239" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_8@10-10">Armamentarium.</quote>
            Juxta templum erat domus quam aedificavit David ad reponenda arma, in cujus circuitu arbores multae; unde dicitur domus saltus. Ipsa quoque non lapidea, sed lignea fuit: ex humore enim caementi et lapidum (ut aiunt) eruginat ferrum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is22-Dd1e244">
          <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e246">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e248">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e250" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_9@9-10">Et congregastis.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e253"><seg type="qs">Terra promissionis, quamvis uberrima</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">inferior quae ab hostibus capi poterat, superior quae non poterat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is22-Dd1e262">
          <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e264">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e266">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e268" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_11@1-2">Et lacum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is22-Rd1e271"><name xml:id="gom-is22-Nd1e272" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e275">Non puteum qui aquam vitalem habet et aeternam, sed lacus contritos qui continere non valent aquam.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e278">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e280" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_11@4-6">Inter duos muros.</quote>
            Scilicet et Novum et Vetus <pb ed="#P" n="1264D"/> Testamentum, fecerunt sibi novas aquas, quas interiores putant et majora continere mysteria quam Vetus Testamentum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is22-Dd1e287">
          <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e289">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e291">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e293" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_12@1-5">Et vocabit Dominus Deus exercituum.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e296"><seg type="qs">Quotidie provocat Dominus haereticos ad poenitentiam</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed vilipendentes et desperantes dicebant: <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e302" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_13@16-21">Comedamus et bibamus, cras enim moriemur<!-- check: Migne cites ier34; text matches is22_13 --></quote>.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is22-Dd1e309">
          <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e311">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e313">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e315" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_14@15-15">Moriamini.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is22-Rd1e318"><name xml:id="gom-is22-Nd1e319" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e322"><seg type="qs">Vitiis, aut cum eis ad inferos descendatis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quae hic dicuntur non pertinent ad captivitatem factam tempore Ezechiae.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is22-Dd1e332">
          <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e334">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e336">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e338" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_15@15-15">Sobnam.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is22-Rd1e341"><name xml:id="gom-is22-Nd1e342" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e345"><seg type="qs">Convertere nunc</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">unde ei Dominus haec mala minatur</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is22-Dd1e354">
          <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e356">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e358">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1265A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e362" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_16@1-3">Quid tu hic?</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e365"><seg type="qs">Ac si diceret: Cur tibi vis aedificare domum?</seg> etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quam sepulcrum et memoria appellandum.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is22-Dd1e374">
          <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e376">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e378">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e380" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_18@1-3">Coronans coronabit te.</quote>
            Qui scilicet quondam habebas coronam pontificis, et sanctificationem in lamina auri (in qua scriptum erat nomen Dei), tribulatione et angustia coronaberis.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e384">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e386" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_18@4-4">Tribulatione.</quote>
            Pro lamina aurea in qua scriptum erat nomen Domini, quam in fronte portabat sacerdos semel in anno.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e390">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e392" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_18@5-6">Quasi pilam.</quote>
            Sicut sphaera in loco declivi et spacioso stare non potet, sic populus tuus in orbis terminos dispergetur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is22-Dd1e397">
          <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e399">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e401">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e403" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_20@7-9">Servum meum Eliacim.</quote>
            Per Sobnam superbum, etc., <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e406" source="http://scta.info/resource/is36_3@4-8">usque ad Filium Helciae,</quote> id est patris <pb ed="#P" n="1265B"/> Domini.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is22-Dd1e413">
          <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e415">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e417">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e419" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_22@3-3">Clavem.</quote>
            Per clavem quam super humerum portat, sceptrum regni et signum victoriae, id est <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e422">crucem possumus</quote> intelligere quam Christus ipse in suo proprio portavit humero.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e425">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e427" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_22@4-5">Domus David.</quote>
            Domum David vocat domum Domini, in qua erat aurea clavis.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e431">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e433" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_22@9-10">Et aperiet.</quote>
            Unde: <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e436" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_22@10-20">Qui aperit et nemo claudit, claudit et nemo aperit.</quote> Quod in passione reseravit claudi non poterit; quod in caeremoniis clausit, nemo aperiet.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is22-Dd1e441">
          <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e443">Versus 24</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e445">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e447" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_24@1-3">Et suspendam super.</quote>
            Unde in Evangelio: <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e450">Omnis populus pendebat ex eo.</quote> Hodie quoque ad verbum sapientiae ejus pendent.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is22-Dd1e455">
          <head xml:id="gom-is22-Hd1e457">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is22-d1e459">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e461" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is22_25@7-8">Auferetur paxillus.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is22-Qd1e464"><seg type="qs">Quae dicuntur, etc., <pb ed="#P" n="1265C"/></seg> usque ad <seg type="qs">Judaei convertentur ad fidem.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
